msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Minori「We're already halfway there...... There's＿been nothing out of the ordinary so＿far.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya vamos a mitad de camino......＿No ha pasado nada fuera de lo＿común hasta ahora.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. If what Kitamura said is true,＿then the path back will be the \"main＿event,\" so to speak.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Si lo que dijo Kitamura es cierto,＿entonces el camino de vuelta será el＿\"plato fuerte\", por así decirlo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You really like ghosts, huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......De verdad te gustan＿los fantasmas, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Minori「I do! But I have zero intuition, so I＿haven't seen a single ghost at all～ So I＿wanna try to see as many as I can, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sí! Pero tengo cero intuición y no he＿visto ni un fantasma～ Quiero intentar＿ver tantos como pueda, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ya veo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Hm? We've had this conversation＿before......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Hm? Ya hemos tenido esta＿conversación antes......）」"

msgid "Minori「Personally, I believe in ghosts.」"
msgstr "Minori「En lo personal, yo creo＿en los fantasmas.」"

msgid "Minori「But as it happens, I've never seen one.＿And I don't believe anyone who says＿they have.」"
msgstr "Minori「Pero resulta que nunca he visto＿uno. Y tampoco le creo a nadie que＿diga que sí los ha visto.」"

msgid "Minori「The same goes for...... people who have＿felt love. I just feel so distant from＿them.」"
msgstr "Minori「Lo mismo pasa con...... la gente＿que ha sentido el amor. Siento＿que está muy lejos de mí.」"

msgid "Minori「Because I can't \"see\" it.」"
msgstr "Minori「Porque no puedo \"verlo\".」"

msgid "Minori「Since I haven't seen any ghosts, I think＿to myself \"I'll never see them\" and give＿up......」"
msgstr "Minori「Como no he visto ningún fantasma,＿pienso \"nunca los veré\" y me＿doy por vencida......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「--!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「--!!」"

msgid "Minori「Huh? Takasu-kun, is something＿wrong?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh? Takasu-kun, ¿pasa algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That's right...... I remember.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Es cierto...... Lo recuerdo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（To her, romance is the same as a＿ghost......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Para ella, el romance es igual＿que un fantasma......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「......?」"
msgstr "Minori「......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Wait, I can't clam up now. I gotta talk to＿Kushieda, just like Taiga told me to......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Espera, no puedo quedarme callado＿ahora. Tengo que hablar con Kushieda,＿tal como me dijo Taiga......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No, that's not it. I want to know how I＿feel about Kushieda right now.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No, no es eso. Quiero saber lo que＿siento por Kushieda ahora mismo.）」"

msgid "Gaze at Kushieda"
msgstr "Mirar fijamente a Kushieda"

msgid "Talk to Kushieda"
msgstr "Hablar con Kushieda"

msgid "Hug Kushieda"
msgstr "Abrazar a Kushieda"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..............................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..............................」"

msgid "Minori「..............................」"
msgstr "Minori「..............................」"

msgid "Minori「Umm, Takasu-kun, 'sup?」"
msgstr "Minori「Ehm, Takasu-kun, ¿qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Whatever it is, you're making this＿reeeally serious face.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sea lo que sea, estás poniendo＿una cara muuuy seria.」"

msgid "Minori「*Gasp* Were you possessed by an evil＿spirit!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ah! ¡¿Te poseyó un espíritu maligno?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No, it's nothing......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No, no es nada......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Kushieda...... I wasn't possessed. This is＿just how my face looks......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Kushieda...... No estoy poseído.＿Así es mi cara nada más......）」"

msgid "Minori「Oooh!! Takasu-kun, that's a nice idea!＿Yessss! In that case, wanna tell ghost＿stories?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Oooh!! ¡Takasu-kun, esa es una gran＿idea! ¡Siiii! En ese caso, ¿contamos＿historias de fantasmas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, just a normal conversation,＿please......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, solo una conversación＿normal, por favor......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Kushieda......!」"

msgid "Minori「Huh?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（She's gone!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿Desapareció?!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Owww～」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ayyy～」"

msgid "Minori「Y-You okay, Takasu-kun!? It was all so＿sudden that I dodged without thinking!＿Sorry, I should have caught you!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿E-Estás bien, Takasu-kun?! ¡Fue＿tan repentino que te esquivé sin pensar!＿¡Perdón, debí atraparte!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I-It's okay... Umm... It's my fault for＿startling you......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Está bien... Ehm... Es culpa＿mía por asustarte......」"

msgid "Minori「But still, that was like whoa! How come＿you collapsed all of a sudden, bud?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Pero qué susto! ¿Cómo es que te＿desplomaste tan de repente, amigo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I can't say \"because I was trying to hug＿you\"......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡No puedo decirle \"porque intentaba＿abrazarte\"......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well, umm...... I was feeling cold so I＿was shifting my weight...... Lost my＿balance......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno, ehm...... Tenía frío y＿pasaba el peso de un pie al otro......＿Perdí el equilibrio......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I'm okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, estoy bien.」"

msgid "Minori「Really? Don't overdo it, 'kay?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿De verdad? No te esfuerces, ¿sí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien.」"

msgid "Minori「Come on! Let's hurry to the main area!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Vamos! ¡Apurémonos a ir＿al área principal!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sí!」"

msgid "Minori「I wonder where Taiga and Haruta are＿right now～ Maybe they saw the ghost＿already. I wonder what it looks like......」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Dónde estarán Taiga y Haruta ahora＿mismo～? Tal vez ya vieron al fantasma.＿Me pregunto cómo será......」"

msgid "Minori「Eee hee hee hee hee!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ji, ji, ji, ji, ji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda, while we're at it, shall we＿take a little break? That way we can＿put some distance between ourselves」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kushieda, ya que estamos, ¿tomamos un＿pequeño descanso? Así podremos dejar＿algo de distancia entre nosotros」"

msgid "Ryuuji「and Kitamura's team. It'll make it even＿scarier.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「y el equipo de Kitamura.＿Así dará aún más miedo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（If she takes control of the＿conversation, we'll get steered into＿ghost stories. I gotta change the）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Si ella toma las riendas de la charla,＿acabaremos hablando de fantasmas.＿Tengo que cambiar el）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（subject......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（tema......）」"

msgid "Minori「So that's what happened～＿Takasu-kun, you only just had the flu,＿too. Maybe you should go home for the」"
msgstr "Minori「Así que eso pasó～ Takasu-kun, además＿acabas de salir de la gripe. Quizá＿deberías irte a casa por」"

msgid "Minori「day.」"
msgstr "Minori「hoy.」"
